Z||000000||AutoXdbdragSE||10-24-2001||12:28 AM||||Ok.. please no flaming of any choices, i know everyone here loves fieros, so do i.<BR>In about 5 months me's gonna be in the market for a new car.  I've been looking around, checking prices, checking what i could concevibly have.. and this is what i came up with.. oh.. and i dont' want a front drive car, all wheel drive is ok.. just not front wheel drive..<P>1. Nissan 300zx Twin Turbo.. aroun 9-11k might be in the budget? so it's included as it's my dream car.<BR>2. Nissan 300zx N/A .. 7k<BR>3. Toyota MR2 turbo.. 5-9k hopefuly find a 93.. 0-60 in 6.6<BR>4. Mazda RX-7 turbo 88-90ish  5-7k<BR>5. Toyota Celica All-trac.. these are just cool 5-7k depending on if i can find one<P>so out of these what would you pick..  I want something faster than a fiero, which all of these.. except maybe the all-trac are.<BR>i'm considering an 87 fiero gt 5 speed, but these run between 5-7k for a car that would be of equal condition as the other car's i'm looking into. i'm not rulling out a fiero entirely, but i want a reliable 7 second 0-60 car||||reg||1
