Z||000003||WampusCat||10-24-2001||12:58 AM||||I always like the SVX.  AWD and about 7 sec 0-60, not sure I'd want to try to work on one though.  Saw this on a quick Autotrader search: <BR>1992 SUBARU SVX, dark GREEN w/grey leather, TOURING pckg., am/fm/CD, sunroof, automatic transmission, cruise control, loaded, 83000 miles, very nice, $6200, (847)991-7650 PALATINE||||reg||1
