Z||000014||Neal||10-24-2001||07:50 PM||||Got a story about the 300zx non turbo, my sister recently about 3 weeks ago bought one, then less than a week after she bought it was stolen from a major mall parking lot.<P>My brief impressions were, nice car, exelent fit and finish (especially for a 10 year old car), stiff ride (i liked it but not what i expected from a supposedly refined jap car), good handler, ok acceleration(but in NO WAY was either better than a nice V6 fiero, reported by my actual seat-o-pants meter).<P>If your looking for nicer than a fiero good choice, but better sports car, look elsewhere.||||reg||1
