Z||000019||Master_Sushi||10-24-2001||09:39 PM||||hmmm..<P>300ZX twin turbos are ok...<P>But I'd rather have an MKIII supra turbo over any of the cars shown here! They are fast, comfertable, good looking, have jap toyota quality, and can be really moded out. The MK4's are nice also, but they cost quite a bit for a nice twin turbo.<BR>And NO, I liked supras *before* the "fast and furious" came out. hehe||||reg||12
